A '''twisted (+)''' is a [[combat]] [[potions|potion]] that boosts the player's [[Ranged]] and [[Defence]] levels by 6 + 16% of their base levels. It can be made with 70 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[cicely]] in the inventory. Making this potion gives 13 Herblore experience.

This potion is the strong variant of the twisted potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].
==Effects==
Ranged boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor RangedLevel \times \frac{16}{100} \rfloor + 6</math>

